{"ts":"2026-09-04T14:42:11.523Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-5.6-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"e7ba12f13833697f75a6c113","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-5.6-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-llbnua"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Sentry-injected release artifacts exceed the CI package budget because pre- and post-injection packlists share one ceiling"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Release run 33882558951 passed the 20,000,000-byte package budget before publication only until Sentry injected debug IDs into the shipped JavaScript. The exact v2026.9.4 artifact then measured 20,140,358 bytes and failed, while a clean pre-injection exact-tag build measures 19,926,990 bytes. Model and gate both artifact phases explicitly so CI constrains the base package, release constrains the actual Sentry-injected package, and immutable exact-tag recovery can publish without moving the tag or weakening source-map observability."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["distribution","packaging","release","sentry"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-09-04T14:42:11.523Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-09-04T14:42:11.523Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:codex"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"CI and release enforce named, reviewable pre-injection and post-injection artifact budgets; the post-injection gate validates the bytes actually published without disabling Sentry debug IDs; negative controls reject an unknown profile and oversize artifacts in either profile; workflow contracts prove the base gate runs before injection and the injected gate runs after it; exact v2026.9.4 recovery passes packaging, npm/npx/bunx and installed-agent acceptance, and GitHub Release verification without moving the immutable tag."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/goal","value":"project management = context management"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/objective","value":"Make package-size assurance represent the exact artifact users install"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/value","value":"The release must preserve Sentry symbolication and artifact-size discipline without a false mismatch between CI and publication environments."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/why_now","value":"Immutable v2026.9.4 is unpublished and release recovery is blocked before npm publication."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-e70zh5"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/environment","value":"GitHub Actions Release exact-tag recovery for v2026.9.4 after Sentry debug-ID injection"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/repro_steps","value":"Build immutable v2026.9.4 and npm pack: 19,926,990 bytes; inject Sentry debug IDs into dist and rerun scripts/release/package-artifact-gate.mjs: hosted run reports 20,140,358 > 20,000,000."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/affected_version","value":"2026.9.4"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/component","value":"release-packaging"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/regression","value":true},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/customer_impact","value":"Validated SDK and CLI changes cannot reach npm, npx, bunx, or GitHub Release."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-23lmm5","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-09-04T14:42:11.523Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-7z